# Rename to CODEOWNERS and replace the teams with your own GitHub teams.
# Specs need the workflow owner's team; agent rules and hooks need the platform team.
/specs/        @<org>/<workflow-owners-team>
/runbooks/     @<org>/<workflow-owners-team>
/AGENTS.md     @<org>/<platform-team>
/.claude/      @<org>/<platform-team>
/.cursor/      @<org>/<platform-team>
